  "userAgreementAndPersonalDataProcessingRules": "User agreement and rules for processing personal data",
  "@userAgreementAndPersonalDataProcessingRules": {},
  "userAgreementAndPersonalDataProcessingRulesDescription": "1. The storage room for servicing air passengers operates around the clock without interruptions.\n2. Items are accepted for storage in any packaging that ensures safety and excludes free access to the contents of damage and contamination of other clients' belongings and storage room equipment.3. The weight of one piece of luggage must not exceed 30 kg.\n4. Fruits, vegetables and other products are accepted for storage only in packaging; The administration is not responsible for their natural damage.\n5. Glass and other breakable items are accepted only in packaging marked “Caution – Glass”\n6. Explosive, flammable, flammable and unpleasantly smelling substances are not accepted for storage. Weapons and ammunition, live birds and other living creatures, documents, money, jewelry.\n7. Receiving things: when receiving things from the storage room, the client must show the storekeeper a number and name.\n8. Items from the storage room are issued out of turn\n9. Items not received by the owner within 6 months from the date of acceptance for storage are considered unclaimed and are sold in the prescribed manner\n10. If the client loses his number, things are issued on the basis of his application upon presentation of his documents and evidence of belonging to him\n11. Compensation for lost license plate is 500 rubles.\n12. Payment is made upon baggage check-in.",
  "@userAgreementAndPersonalDataProcessingRulesDescription": {},
