  "weAnswerTheMostFrequentQuestions": "We answer the most frequently asked questions. If you don’t find your answer, write to support",
  "@weAnswerTheMostFrequentQuestions": {},
  "faqHowPayOrder": "How to pay for an order?",
  "@faqHowPayOrder": {},
  "faqHowPayOrderDescription": "To place and pay for your order, you must go to the “Leave luggage” section and follow the instructions on the screen.\nAfter placing your order, you can pay for it in the mobile application (Fast Payment System, payment systems - MIR, SberPay, Visa, MasterCard) or at the counter in \"Luggage storage.\" After placing your order, a QR code will appear in the mobile application, which must be presented to the luggage storage employee to check in your luggage. To check in luggage for storage, you must pay for the first day according to the selected tariff.",
  "@faqHowPayOrderDescription": {},
  "faqWhichRateChoose": "Which tariff should I choose?",
  "@faqWhichRateChoose": {},
  "faqWhichRateChooseDescription": "Standard tariff\n\nLuggage storage fee is charged for each item (1 piece up to 203 cm). The first calendar day (from 00:00 to 23:59) – 700 ₽, each subsequent calendar day – 300 ₽ The price includes luggage storage and sealing.\n\nStandard+ tariff\n\nLuggage storage fee is charged for each subject (1 place over 203 cm). The first calendar day (from 00:00 to 23:59) – 1250 ₽, each subsequent calendar day – 600 ₽ The price includes luggage storage and sealing.\n\nStandard Light tariff\n\nLuggage storage fee is charged for each item (1 place up to 203 cm). The first calendar day (from 00:00 to 23:59) – 600 ₽, each subsequent calendar day – 300 ₽ The price includes luggage storage service.\n\nStandard Light+ tariff\n\nLuggage storage fee is charged for each item ( 1 place over 203 cm). The first calendar day (from 00:00 to 23:59) – 1150 ₽, every subsequent calendar day – 600 ₽ The price includes luggage storage service.",
  "@faqWhichRateChooseDescription": {},
  "faqHowManyItemsInOrder": "How many items can there be in an order?",
  "@faqHowManyItemsInOrder": {},
  "faqHowManyItemsInOrderDescription": "In the storage room, up to 10 pieces of luggage can be stored inclusive.\nRequirements for luggage: in any packaging that ensures safety, preventing free access to the contents, damage and contamination of things of other clients and storage room equipment. The weight of one piece of luggage must not exceed 30 kg. Fruits, vegetables and other products are accepted for storage only in packaging. The administration is not responsible for their natural deterioration. Glass and other breakable items will only be accepted in packaging marked “Caution – Glass.” Explosive, flammable, flammable and unpleasant-smelling substances are not accepted for storage. Weapons and ammunition, live birds and other animals, documents, money, jewelry.",
  "@faqHowManyItemsInOrderDescription": {},
  "faqNoQRCode": "What to do if there is no QR code?",
  "@faqNoQRCode": {},
  "faqNoQRCodeDescription": "If a QR code for checking in your luggage does not appear in the mobile application after placing an order and paying for it, you must contact support.",
  "@faqNoQRCodeDescription": {},
  "faqHowCancelOrder": "How to cancel an order?",
  "@faqHowCancelOrder": {},
  "faqHowCancelOrderDescription": "To cancel an order, you must go to the \"Orders\" section on the main screen of the mobile application and select the order you want to cancel. Open the additional menu and select \"Cancel order\". In this case, the order will be canceled and deleted from the application. If you have paid for the order, the funds will be returned to your payment account. If you want to make changes to your order and use it later, use the “Make a return” button.",
  "@faqHowCancelOrderDescription": {},
